OL,3,AHome secretary plans to tackle
OL,4,A'perception of two-tier policing'
OL,5,
OL,6,FHome Secretary Shabana Mahmood is to
OL,7,Fannounce stronger guidance on police
OL,8,Fimpartiality to tackle what she calls
OL,9,Fthe "corrosive and growing perception
OL,10,Fof two-tier policing".b@/
OL,12,FShe will tell a conference of police
OL,13,Fchiefs that they should avoid what she
OL,14,Fcalls "misguided attempts at course
OL,15,Fcorrection" where the pursuit of
OL,16,Fequality leads instead to differential
OL,17,Ftreatment.
OL,19,FRecent complaints about alleged
OL,20,Ftwo-tier policing have mostly come from
OL,21,Fthose on the right in politics.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
